    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/e4ae7e218647794d51f407ad92805670.poster.avif?t=1751285422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/e4ae7e218647794d51f407ad92805670.webm?t=1751285422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/e4ae7e218647794d51f407ad92805670.mp4?t=1751285422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Create worlds</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect furniture, decorate your home and invite friends over to play games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/c53447684025ba94f864991a8186cf94.poster.avif?t=1751285422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/c53447684025ba94f864991a8186cf94.webm?t=1751285422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/c53447684025ba94f864991a8186cf94.mp4?t=1751285422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Express yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the perfect outfit to hug, dance or slap with!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/53dbf73392fbba0821746ed0a9f6687c.avif?t=1751285422\" /></div><strong>Family friendly fun</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moderated for ages 13+. You can lock rooms, filter chat, kick, block and report.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/64dd4853a1220b343053a6c2912999f8.avif?t=1751285422\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create art and get paid</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use our free tools to upload to the Steam Workshop. Approved items get a cut of each sale!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/9f87b8d212b8ce0c12a64c896579f3db.webp?t=1751285422\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Club Werewolf is split into day and night phases. During the day, vote who you think is a werewolf. At night, roles can use their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Team Town - </strong>win by uncovering all werewolves.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Villager \u2013</strong> Use chat to uncover werewolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seer \u2013</strong> Uncover a villager\u2019s role.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bodyguard \u2013</strong> Protect a villager from an attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martyr \u2013</strong> Die in place of an attacked villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survivor \u2013</strong> Survive one attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spy \u2013</strong> See evil chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Witness \u2013</strong> Watch over a villager.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Team Werewolf, can use evil chat - </strong>Win by outnumbering the town.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Werewolf \u2013</strong> Kill a villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traitor \u2013</strong> Use chat to misdirect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Witch -</strong> Uncover a villager\u2019s role.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who can you trust and who can you trick into helping you survive another night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/9f87b8d212b8ce0c12a64c896579f3db.webp?t=1751285422\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <i>How do I get items?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each week, level up 7 times to get 7 items. There is no gambling. Purchases are optional and only cosmetic. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Can I trade or sell my items?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes! Steam accounts that are not limited can trade items with other players or sell items on the Steam Community Market to buy other Steam games.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Can you let everyone add items to the game?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We use Steam's Inventory Service which holds us responsible for what we upload. Therefore, we are required to moderate what we approve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/9f87b8d212b8ce0c12a64c896579f3db.webp?t=1751285422\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/0a2dd6254b06841a1979786285a92512.avif?t=1751285422\" /></div><strong>Follow us</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the buttons above to join our friendly community. Be the first to know about playtests and updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Club!</strong></p>",
